# DABS BUSINESS LOGIC & COMPLIANCE ENFORCEMENT
Utah Package Agency requirements and DABS-specific business rules

## DABS SYSTEM CONTEXT
- **Client**: Hills & Hollows LLC (Utah Package Agency - Boulder, UT)
- **Product Range**: 1,239 SKUs (spirits, wine, beer)
- **Compliance**: Utah Package Agency 3-year contract requirements
- **Critical Timing**: Monthly DABS price updates must complete within 1 hour

## CRITICAL BUSINESS METRICS
MANDATORY success criteria:
- **Time Reduction**: 90% reduction (10+ hours → <1 hour weekly)
- **Error Rate**: <0.1% error rate requirement (vs current ~2% manual rate)
- **Processing Speed**: Complete 1,239 SKUs within 15 minutes
- **System Availability**: 99% uptime requirement
- **Compliance**: 100% on-time monthly DABS reporting

## DABS FILE PROCESSING RULES
### Required Data Validation
MANDATORY checks for all DABS Excel files:
- **Required Columns**: ["SKU", "ProductName", "RetailPrice", "Category"]
- **Price Variance**: Alert if >20% change from previous price
- **SKU Validation**: All 1,239 SKUs must be present
- **Data Types**: Enforce correct data types for all fields
- **Missing Data**: NEVER process files with missing required data

### Processing Requirements
- **Timeout**: 30-minute maximum processing time
- **Backup**: Always backup original files before processing
- **Checksum**: Validate file integrity before processing
- **Audit Trail**: Log every price change with timestamp and source
- **Rollback**: Maintain rollback capability for failed updates

## UTAH PACKAGE AGENCY COMPLIANCE
### Monthly Reporting Requirements
MANDATORY compliance elements:
- **Timing**: Monthly reports due by 10th of following month
- **Format**: Exact DABS specifications required
- **Content**: Complete sales data, inventory levels, purchase records
- **Retention**: 7-year data retention for audit purposes
- **Accuracy**: Zero tolerance for compliance reporting errors

## STAKEHOLDER SUCCESS CRITERIA
### Hills & Hollows LLC Requirements
- **90% Time Reduction**: Eliminate 10+ hours weekly manual work
- **Staff Relief**: Return Tessa and Heather to 40-hour weeks
- **Error Elimination**: Reduce pricing errors from 2% to <0.1% error rate
- **Compliance Assurance**: Zero Utah Package Agency violations

## VIOLATION PREVENTION
❌ NEVER process incomplete DABS files
❌ NEVER skip price validation checks
❌ NEVER allow >20% price variance without approval
❌ NEVER process without complete audit trail
❌ NEVER compromise Utah compliance requirements

